{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q417824","formula":"C₂₂H₂₄ClFN₄O₃","hill":"C22H24ClFN4O3","elements":["H","C","N","O","F","Cl"],"composition":{"C":22.0,"F":1.0,"H":24.0,"N":4.0,"O":3.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Gefitinib","ru":"Гефитиниб","uk":"Гефітиніб"},"descriptions":{"en":"Gefitinib, sold under the brand name Iressa, is a medication used for certain breast, lung and other cancers. Gefitinib is an EGFR inhibitor, like erlotinib, which interrupts signaling through the epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR) in target cells. Therefore, it is only effective in cancers with mutated and overactive EGFR, but resistances to gefitinib can arise through other mutations.","ru":"Гефитиниб (лат. Gefitinib) (ZD1839) — онкологический лекарственный препарат, применяемый в терапии рака лёгкого. Препарат был разработан компанией AstraZeneca и распространяется под торговым названием Иресса.","uk":"Гефітиніб (англ. Gefitinib, лат. Gefitinibum) — синтетичний лікарський препарат, який належить до групи інгібіторів протеїнтирозинкінази, що застосовується перорально."},"fame":25,"pubchemCid":123631,"mass":446.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"COC1=C(C=C2C(=C1)N=CN=C2NC3=CC(=C(C=C3)F)Cl)OCCCN4CCOCC4","inchikey":"XGALLCVXEZPNRQ-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"N-(3-chloro-4-fluorophenyl)-7-methoxy-6-(3-morpholin-4-ylpropoxy)quinazolin-4-amine","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"123631","atoms":55,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-5.767,"y":0.379,"z":2.197,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-6.513,"y":-0.403,"z":-0.564,"el":"F"},{"x":-1.567,"y":3.914,"z":-1.276,"el":"O"},{"x":3.419,"y":0.984,"z":0.762,"el":"O"},{"x":5.181,"y":-0.947,"z":-0.179,"el":"O"},{"x":0.806,"y":3.171,"z":0.109,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.158,"y":-1.209,"z":0.606,"el":"N"},{"x":1.571,"y":-3.995,"z":-0.78,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.687,"y":-3.356,"z":-0.235,"el":"N